OL,3,GNEWSAWeather warnings in place ahead of
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amber warning has been issued for
OL,7,Fparts of Northern Ireland during Storm
OL,8,FBoelo on Saturday night.
OL,10,FThe Met Office alert for counties
OL,11,FAntrim and Londonderry lasts from 21:00
OL,12,FBST on Saturday until 21:00 GMT on
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FThe organisation is warning of
OL,16,Fwidespread gusts up to 70mph (115kph),
OL,17,Fand up to 80mph (130kph) around exposed
OL,18,Fcoastal areas.
OL,20,FStrong winds of up to 75mph could cause
OL,21,Fdisruption across other parts of
OL,22,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
